    "research": "PubMed E-utilities searches covered 30 fresh rheumatoid-arthritis self-management topics, all classified as non-prescription candidates. The final query set returned 160 unique PubMed PMIDs, 160 article IDs requested, 160 fetched article records, and 156 abstracts available for inspection because four fetched records lacked abstracts. Retained numeric intervention-versus-control results or valid relative effects were verified for PMID records: 39179363, 40968365, 38171602, 25748549, 33307206, 18487901, 39827846, 28106666, 35951745, 35389367, 39498761, 38498833, 40744898, 17331241, 28471579, 36990808, 34569129, 40790488, 35238767, 28442212, 35640116, 36617162, 39112976, 32055820, 38922552, 40646666, 27135916, and 29302905. Twenty-eight PubMed references were added across 28 new entries. New entries cover exercise, hand exercise, yoga, tai chi, online mindfulness and cognitive behavioral therapy, cognitive behavioral therapy for insomnia, self-management education, patient education, physiotherapy, hydrotherapy, balneotherapy, massage, progressive relaxation, heat therapy, whole-body cryotherapy, therapeutic ultrasound, weight loss, plant-based and Mediterranean diets, anti-inflammatory diet, omega-3, vitamin D, and probiotics. Qigong, occupational therapy, acupuncture, TENS, and photobiomodulation were screened because the selected PubMed records did not provide a retained topic-specific numeric intervention-versus-control magnitude or valid relative effect. No build error or new targeted comparison/effect/line warning remained. One truthful unknown-sample-size warning and five truthful thin-study warnings remain for the retained entries.",
